s=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A      <span><span><a href=\"../../../spoc/Spoc_framework/Framework_sig/index.html#type-exec_arg\">Spoc_framework.Framework_sig.exec_arg</a> array</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A      unit)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">param_types</span>:<span><a href=\"../../../spoc/Sarek_ir_types/index.html#type-elttype\">Sarek_ir_types.elttype</a> list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-kernel\">kernel</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Create a Native-only kernel (no IR)</p></div></div><h2 id=\"accessors\"><a href=\"#accessors\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Accessors</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-name\"><a href=\"#val-name\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> name : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-kernel\">kernel</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Get the kernel name</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-ir\"><a href=\"#val-ir\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> ir : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-kernel\">kernel</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../../../spoc/Sarek_ir_types/index.html#type-kernel\">Sarek_ir_types.kernel</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Get the IR (forces evaluation if lazy)</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-has_native\"><a href=\"#val-has_native\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> has_native : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-kernel\">kernel</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Check if native function is available</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-native_fn\"><a href=\"#val-native_fn\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> native_fn : \u000A  <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-kernel\">kernel</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">block</span>:<a href=\"../../../spoc/Spoc_framework/Framework_sig/index.html#type-dims\">Spoc_framework.Framework_sig.dims</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">grid</span>:<a href=\"../../../spoc/Spoc_framework/Framework_sig/index.html#type-dims\">Spoc_framework.Framework_sig.dims</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><a href=\"../../../spoc/Spoc_framework/Framework_sig/index.html#type-exec_arg\">Spoc_framework.Framework_sig.exec_arg</a> array</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Get the native function (raises if not available)</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-param_types\"><a href=\"#val-param_types\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> param_types : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-kernel\">kernel</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../../../spoc/Sarek_ir_types/index.html#type-elttype\">Sarek_ir_types.elttype</a> list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Get parameter types</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-extensions\"><a href=\"#val-extensions\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> extensions : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-kernel\">kernel</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Kirc_types/index.html#type-extension\">Kirc_types.extension</a> array</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Get extensions</p></div></div><h2 id=\"conversion-from-legacy-kirc\"><a href=\"#conversion-from-legacy-kirc\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Conversion from Legacy Kirc</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-exec_arg_to_native_arg\"><a href=\"#val-exec_arg_to_native_arg\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> exec_arg_to_native_arg : \u000A  <span><a href=\"../../../spoc/Spoc_framework/Framework_sig/index.html#type-exec_arg\">Spoc_framework.Framework_sig.exec_arg</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <a href=\"../../../spoc/Sarek_ir_types/index.html#type-native_arg\">Sarek_ir_types.native_arg</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Convert exec_arg to native_arg. This bridges Framework_sig.exec_arg (typed execution args) to Sarek_ir_types.native_arg (native function args).</p></div></div><h2 id=\"execution\"><a href=\"#execution\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Execution</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-run\"><a href=\"#val-run\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> run : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">device</span>:<a href=\"../../Spoc_core/Device/index.html#type-t\">Spoc_core.Device.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">block</span>:<a href=\"../../../spoc/Spoc_framework/Framework_sig/index.html#type-dims\">Spoc_framework.Framework_sig.dims</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">grid</span>:<a href=\"../../../spoc/Spoc_framework/Framework_sig/index.html#type-dims\">Spoc_framework.Framework_sig.dims</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?shared_mem</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-kernel\">kernel</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><a href=\"../../../spoc/Spoc_framework/Framework_sig/index.html#type-exec_arg\">Spoc_framework.Framework_sig.exec_arg</a> array</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Execute a kernel on a device with exec_arg array args. Note: Only works for Native backend. For JIT backends (CUDA/OpenCL), use run_with_args which provides properly typed arguments.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-run_with_args\"><a href=\"#val-run_with_args\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> run_with_args : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">device</span>:<a href=\"../../Spoc_core/Device/index.html#type-t\">Spoc_core.Device.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">block</span>:<a href=\"../../../spoc/Spoc_framework/Framework_sig/index.html#type-dims\">Spoc_framework.Framework_sig.dims</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">grid</span>:<a href=\"../../../spoc/Spoc_framework/Framework_sig/index.html#type-dims\">Spoc_framework.Framework_sig.dims</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?shared_mem</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-kernel\">kernel</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><a href=\"../Execute/index.html#type-vector_arg\">Execute.vector_arg</a> list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Execute a kernel with explicit typed arguments. Works for all backends (Native, CUDA, OpenCL). Uses plugin dispatch via Execute.run.</p></div></div><h2 id=\"utilities\"><a href=\"#utilities\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Utilities</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-source_for_backend\"><a href=\"#val-source_for_backend\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> source_for_backend : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-kernel\">kernel</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"label\">backend</span>:string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Get generated source for a specific backend. Uses plugin's generate_source.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-requires_fp64\"><a href=\"#val-requires_fp64\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> requires_fp64 : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-kernel\">kernel</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Check if kernel requires FP64 extension</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-requires_fp32\"><a href=\"#val-requires_fp32\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> requires_fp32 : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-kernel\">kernel</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Check if kernel requires FP32 extension</p></div></div><h2 id=\"debugging\"><a href=\"#debugging\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Debugging</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-pp_ir\"><a href=\"#val-pp_ir\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> pp_ir : <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.Format.formatter <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-kernel\">kernel</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Pretty-print the IR</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-ir_to_string\"><a href=\"#val-ir_to_string\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> ir_to_string : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-kernel\">kernel</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Get IR as string</p></div></div>"}